  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-08-21T01:48:29.249Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In #open-beta-discussion we figured out that it's possible to make extremely long names and descriptions for content, which can break not only new open-beta SDK, but also old SDK UI (that's why I posing in SDK Bug Reports, not Open Beta), as well as Web Site. I think, name and desc should be limited at VRChat API level and SDK should be able to deal with long descriptions. At this moment, this is not seems to be critical and can only affect author itself, but in future, as description becomes useful and relevant over development, it can cause troubles.\n\nScreens by @IgbarVonSquid#7735",
